#! seed 1861
# Civil War Strategy as the Rebels, attacking Washington (QB64Rust's tools/screen/README.md, "Places
# and rules"). In the Utility menu: Side (the Rebels), and the enemy made passive (Aggress three times). In March
# 1861 Jackson moves from Front Royal to Manassas; in May, July and September he attacks Washington from there and
# loses. In November the Union wins on a 3:1 force ratio: No-Override at the End Game menu (the condition becomes
# 4:1) and the game goes on; in January 1862 it is reached again: Press Onward at the Options (5:1); in March it is
# reached again: Quit this Game. The Union's victory screen, the Rebel Hall of Fame, Game Over, Quit.

# The waits of the computer's turns: a space each; a Retreat menu: the city it starts on; a main menu: END TURN;
# the End Turn menu: Yes. The menus at the game's end are answered by steps.
rule 1:R key space
rule 1:P key space
rule 1:B key space
rule 1:U key space
rule 1:K key space
rule 1:I key space
rule 1:N key space
rule 1:S key space
rule 1:H key space
rule 1:G key space
rule 1:F key space
rule 1:L key space
rule 2:M text e
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key enter

# The title menu: Start NEW Game; March 1861, the main menu: UTILITY, Side, UTILITY, Aggress three times, out.
play until 2:V
digest
text s
# The scenario menu: the Standard Map.
play until 2:S
text s
play until 2:M
digest
text u
prompt
text s
prompt
digest
text u
prompt
text a
prompt
text a
prompt
text a
prompt
key esc
# Moves: from Front Royal to Manassas; END TURN, Yes.
prompt
text m
prompt
digest
text f
prompt
digest
text m
prompt
text e
prompt
text y
# Three months: Moves from Manassas to Washington; END TURN, Yes.
repeat 3
play until 2:M
digest
text m
prompt
text m
prompt
digest
text w
prompt
text e
prompt
text y
end
# November 1861: the End Game menu, No-Override; a month.
play until 2:E
state
text n
play until 2:M
digest
text e
# January 1862: the Options, Press Onward; a month.
play until 2:O
digest
text n
play until 2:M
digest
text e
# March 1862: the Options, Quit this Game; the Union's victory screen; the Rebel Hall of Fame: the commander's name;
# Game Over; the title menu: Quit; END's key.
play until 2:O
state
text q
play until 4
state
text Lee
key enter
play until 2:V
digest
text q
repeat space
